      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "selflessness, on your own."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Now I trust that you won't"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 99,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "abuse what I have to teach you."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "My test may seem too strict,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "but it is impossible to learn"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Spiritual Bestowment without the right discipline. As with all"
    },
    {
