      "text" : "really named this skill, but that is what it is usually called by"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 133,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "other Monks who have seen it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Remember that this skill has a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 137,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "long Cast Time and Skill Delay,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 138,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "so use it very carefully. This"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "skill will let you give a Spirit Sphere to one of your Party"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Members by consuming 40 SP."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 142,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 143,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "You will better understand"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "the use of this skill if you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "practice. Keep in mind that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 146,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "fighting may be necessary at"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 147,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "times, but it is a means to an"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 148,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "end, and not an end in itself."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 152,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 153,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Our skills should not be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 154,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "used to shed blood. If you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 155,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "can transcend conflict, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 156,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "will know that fighting has"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 157,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "no worth, no value. Peace"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 158,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "be with you, my friend."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 162,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 163,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Have you learned the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 164,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "meaning of selflessness?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 165,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "When you abandon greed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 166,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "and the desires of the world,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 167,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "you will be ready for my teaching."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 172,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 173,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Fighting is meaningless."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 174,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Transcend conflict and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 175,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "difference through the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 176,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "realization that all are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 177,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "one. Discipline your mind"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 178,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "and the truth will be revealed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 180,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 181,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Hm? To what purpose have"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 182,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "you come to visit me? Ah, so"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 183,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "you wish to learn the skill that I have developed. My colleague"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 184,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "was right: more and more people have been wanting to learn this."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 186,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 187,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Do not misunderstand me."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 188,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "It is true that power and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 189,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "justice, wisdom and action"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 190,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "must be balanced. However,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 191,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "I have been visited by too many power hungry, bloodthirsty people."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 193,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 194,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "In all fairness, I shall"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 195,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "give you a chance. Prove"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 196,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "to me that you would use"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 197,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "the skills I teach you for"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 198,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "peace and justice. Prove that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 199,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "you are free from selfishness."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 204,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 205,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Fighting is meaningless."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 206,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "Transcend conflict and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 207,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "difference through the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 208,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "realization that all are"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 209,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "one. Discipline your mind"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 210,
      "npc" : "Apprentice Monk",
      "text" : "and the truth will be revealed."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 217,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 218,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "How did you convince"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 219,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "that monk to teach you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 220,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Spiritual Bestowment? It'd"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 221,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "be nice to popularize both"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 222,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "of our specialty skills, but the world may not be ready yet."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 226,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "To begin, Excruciating Palm"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "is performed by taking your"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 229,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "inner strength and making it"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 230,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "into outer strength. Then, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 231,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "focus all of that into your palm. You'll explode if you do it wrong."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 233,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 234,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "This skill truly causes"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "excruciating pain, consuming"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "20 SP and even 10 HP. It will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 237,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "knock back monsters with the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 238,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "chance of stunning them, but only the targeted monster is damaged."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "If you use this skill on"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "other players, it will cause"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "a certain amount of damage,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 244,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "but it won't knock back other"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 245,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "players near the original target. Does that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Anyway, keep practicing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "these principles and you'll"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 250,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "master Excruciating Palm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 251,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "You should definitely be able"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "to do it since you've learned"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Spiritual Endowment."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Well, we've completed"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "the lesson. I hope you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 260,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "use your new skills to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 261,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "fight for justice and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 262,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "combat evil. Goodbye"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 263,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "for now, my friend."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 267,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 268,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "What's that...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 269,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "You've learned the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 270,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Spiritual Bestowment"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 271,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "skill? I assume that you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 272,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "wish to learn Excruciating"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 273,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Palm next. Am I correct?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 275,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 276,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Hm. Well, you are strong"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 277,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "enough to handily defeat a"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 278,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "good number of Mandragoras."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 279,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "All right. You seem to be ready. Come back in a little while so"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 280,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "that I can finish preparations."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 287,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 288,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "What's that...?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 289,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "You've learned the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 290,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Spiritual Bestowment"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 291,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "skill? I assume that you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 292,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "wish to learn Excruciating"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 293,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Palm next. Am I correct?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 295,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 296,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "As I mentioned to you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 297,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "before, you must subjugate"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 298,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Mandragoras to prove that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 299,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "you are qualified, in terms"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 300,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "of strength and compassion,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 301,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "to learn Excruciating Palm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 303,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 304,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Fight to protect those"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 305,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "innocents terrorized by"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 306,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "the aggressive Mandragoras."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 307,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "If you bring me ^FF000020 Stems^000000 and"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 308,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "^FF00003 Shoots^000000, I will be satisfied with this proof of your ability."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 310,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 311,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Do you understand now?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 315,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 316,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Have you come to learn"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 317,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Excruciating Palm? If only"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 318,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "that were possible. There"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 319,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "are two obstacles we face"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 320,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "in fulfilling your request."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 322,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 323,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Firstly, you must learn"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 324,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "the Spiritual Bestowment"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 325,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "skill beforehand. It will be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 326,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "difficult to get that monk"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 327,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "to teach it to you, if not"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 328,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "outright impossible."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 330,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 331,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Secondly, you will need"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 332,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "to pass my little test of"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 333,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "strength, so that I can be"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 334,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "use that your body can endure"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 335,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "the awesome power involved"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 336,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "in using Excruciating Palm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 338,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 339,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Mm. I know that Mandragoras"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 340,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "have been menacing travelers,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 341,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "so if you can prove to me that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 342,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "you've been hunting them, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 343,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "will prove worthy of learning"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 344,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Excruciating Palm."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 346,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 347,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "If you can somehow convince"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 348,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "that monk to teach you how to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 349,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "perform Spiritual Bestowment,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 350,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "I shall then ask you to bring"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 351,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "^FF000020 Stems^000000 and ^FF00003 Shoots^000000 from"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 352,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "hunting Mandragoras."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 354,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 355,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Of course, completing"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 356,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "my test is meaningless"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 357,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "if you do not first learn the"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 358,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Spiritual Bestowment skill."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 359,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "I wish you luck with that..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 364,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 365,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "There is a pacifist monk"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 366,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "living in seclusion that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 367,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "can teach the Spiritual"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 368,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Bestowment skill. However,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 369,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "he is stubborn, and has refused many who wish to learn from him."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 371,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 372,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "It would be good if"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 373,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "you can convince him"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 374,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "to teach it to you, as it is"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 375,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "impossible to learn how"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 376,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "to perform this skill alone."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 377,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "It's really quite a pity..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 381,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 382,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Power without justice will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 383,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "not last. Justice without"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 384,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "power cannot be upheld."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 385,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Power does not equate to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 386,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "justice, but true justice can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 387,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "be the means to power."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 389,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 390,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Always remember this truth."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 391,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Justice and power, compassion"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 392,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "and strength, wisdom and action. These are all complements that"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 393,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "go hand in hand and must always"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 394,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "be harmoniousy balanced."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 396,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 397,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "So it is with some skills."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 398,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "I have developed a skill"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 399,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "that is the pure manifestation"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 400,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "of power, Excruciating Palm!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 401,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "However, it is useless without"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 402,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "its complement to balance it."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 404,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 405,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "The complement to my skill"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 406,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "is a skill known as Spiritual"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 407,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Bestowment, which can only"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 408,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "be taught by one Monk. However,"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 409,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "he refuses to teach it to others, believing they are unworthy."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 411,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 412,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Although I've let him know"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 413,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "that he should popularize his"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 414,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "teaching of that skill, I must respect his decision. Still, you"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 415,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "may try talking to him if you wish to try to learn some new skills."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 418,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 419,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "To find him, simply seek"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 420,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "out the monk who always"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 421,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "preaches the empty meaning"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 422,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "of fighting. That will be him."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 426,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "[Monk]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 427,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Power without justice will"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 428,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "not last. Justice without"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 429,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "power cannot be upheld."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 430,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "Power does not equate to"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 431,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "justice, but true justice can"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 432,
      "npc" : "Monk",
      "text" : "be the means to power."
    }
  ]
}